{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wudi-e-o026a","title":"曹操第一次征陶谦","accounts":[{"id":"wudi-e-o026a-account","label":"正文","text":"曹操秋季征陶谦，攻下十余城，陶谦守城不出。","evidence":["wudi-e-o026a-q"]},{"id":"gongsuntao-a-207e9349b02793f53360","label":"正文","text":"初平四年太祖征谦彭城大战谦败退守郯","evidence":["gongsuntao-q-5a872d064dcb5abaf09c"]},{"id":"gongsuntao-a-9e4131419b8daec22fc5","label":"裴注·吴书","text":"曹公知谦不罢兵进攻彭城谦击之田楷救谦","evidence":["gongsuntao-q-f147dfe88cb7427b4e5c"]}],"participants":[{"person":"cao-cao","role":"征讨","evidence":["wudi-e-o026a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0095","role":"固守","evidence":["wudi-e-o026a-q"]},{"person":"xianzhu-p0017","role":"青州刺史、亦以兵救谦","evidence":["gongsuntao-q-f147dfe88cb7427b4e5c"]}],"place":{"text":"徐州","evidence":["wudi-e-o026a-q"]},"time":{"label":"初平四年秋","year":193,"precision":"year","basis":"纪年经本批逐段审定；年份依据见所引原文纪年与现代注释。","evidence":["wudi-e-o026a-q","wudi-q-o024","wudi-q-b-5e63888ed5d8c41275f1"],"chronology":"wudi-y193","dating_review":{"anchor":"wudi-q-o024","basis":"初平四年秋","reviewed":true}},"source_order":[1,188,"O026a"],"order":93}],"persons":[{"id":"cao-cao","name":"曹操","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0095","name":"陶谦","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"xianzhu-p0017","name":"田楷","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"gongsuntao-q-5a872d064dcb5abaf09c","section":"chapter-008","block":"b-d62dba1d26dbc118a0ed","layer":"original","quote":"初平四年，太祖征谦。攻拔十余城，至彭城，大战。谦兵败走，死者万数，泗水为之不流〖7〗。谦退守郯，太祖以粮少，引军还","section_title":"二公孙陶四张传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0021.xhtml","index":125,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":57},{"id":"gongsuntao-q-f147dfe88cb7427b4e5c","section":"chapter-008","block":"b-b003f52427451302a092","layer":"pei","quote":"曹公得谦上事，知不罢兵。乃进攻彭城，多杀人民。谦引兵击之，青州刺史田楷亦以兵救谦。公引兵还","attribution":"裴注·吴书","section_title":"二公孙陶四张传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0021.xhtml","index":140,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-df575ef0b922cb13c6c5","start":636,"end":681},{"id":"wudi-e-o026a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-5dfff8df0932ae2bd730","layer":"original","quote":"秋，太祖征陶谦，下十余城。谦守城不敢出。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":187,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":20},{"id":"wudi-q-b-5e63888ed5d8c41275f1","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-5e63888ed5d8c41275f1","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗四年：初平四年（公元 193）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":190,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-c3dba248d94a4751844d","start":0,"end":19},{"id":"wudi-q-o024","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-c2e697c9981c6cd8d3e8","layer":"original","quote":"四年春〖1〗，军鄄城〖2〗。荆州牧刘表断术粮道〖3〗。术引军入陈留，屯封丘〖4〗；黑山余贼及于夫罗等佐之。术使将刘详屯匡亭〖5〗。太祖击详，术救之；与战，大破之。术退保封丘，遂围之；未合，术走襄邑〖6〗。追到太寿〖7〗，决渠水灌城；走宁陵〖8〗。又追之，走九江〖9〗。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":185,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":134}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
